    "explanation": "The SGD 8.00 cancellation fee is refunded to the rider in full. The decisive fact is the length of the driver's hold at the pickup. The GPS trace (EV-GPS-09103) shows a single continuous in-geofence run of 240 seconds across 25 stationary fixes (17:15:00 to 17:19:00), and the trip record (EV-TRIP-09103) places the pickup at Plaza Singapura, a LARGE_VENUE, for which the policy fixes a minimum dwell of 300 seconds. That is a 60-second shortfall, and it is measured on the reading most favourable to the driver's own clause: POL-NS-01(c) starts the clock at the first qualifying in-geofence fix, not at the 'arrived' tap, and even the 'arrived' tap (17:15:20) to cancellation (17:19:00) gives only 220 seconds. POL-NS-01 is conjunctive, so the shortfall defeats the charge outright, and POL-NS-06 then requires the fee to be refunded in full whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded. The rider's distance from the pin (about 519 m, with zero qualifying rider fixes) and the absence of any rider chat message therefore do not matter to the outcome. The driver's advocate fairly conceded the 60-second shortfall, and no traffic advisory can rescue it: EV-ADVIS-09103-01 is MISSING (no payload, weight 0.0) and POL-NS-06(i) needs a present, populated advisory of a qualifying type before separate in-geofence intervals may be summed; in any event there is only one in-geofence interval. The amount is taken from the fare breakdown: the SGD 8.00 charged line reconciles with the fee_schedule resolution rule, being the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone-class fee (SGD 4.00) and the RYDE_XL vehicle-tier fee (SGD 8.00), with the vehicle tier producing the figure. No driver compensation is payable, because POL-NS-07 requires POL-NS-01 to be satisfied in full and POL-NS-06 displaces it here; the anti-farming check is academic. No escalation limb fires: the trace has no gaps (25 fixes at a 10-second cadence, max gap 0.0), the arrival marker sits 20 seconds from the first fix (inside the 90-second clock-skew threshold), the chat log holds all 3 messages the trip record counts, the fee reconciles, and the counterparty-dispute and no-show-dispute counters are all 0. The deciding fact is carried by the GPS trace and the trip record at full weight, so confidence is above the 0.70 floor.",
